ssets/steam/apps/3126270/extras/ecda97894e3d1c91a92206f392537f8f.mp4?t=1750162141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MINI GAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journey, you will find arcade machines to help you make progress through the game. They offer multiple games based on classics like Snake, Minesweeper, Maze crawler and 2048.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
